libnginx-mod-http-coraza source for Keel Linux
==============================================

The repository follows DEP-14 as git-buildpackage repositories on salsa
do: upstream/latest holds the imported upstream tarballs, pristine-tar
their deltas, and keel/trixie this package.

The orig tarball is upstream's GitHub release archive:

  https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza-nginx/archive/refs/tags/v0.21.0.tar.gz
  libnginx-mod-http-coraza_0.21.0.orig.tar.gz
  sha256 ff0e9d07003f9514402a7b1e7c44b500d29505a18088a95fce17df84f03835c8

Upstream ships a debian/ directory of its own; this package replaces it.
soname-dlopen.patch comes from it.
